        "original_id": "d2ad2118-b598-5428-8906-410309a309e6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim Armstrong, Tori Amos\n- Roles: singer, guitarist, singer-songwriter, pianist, composer, classically trained musician\n- Bands/Groups: Rancid, Transplants\n- Products: The Stories Are True\n- Companies/Labels: Hellcat Records\n\nFacts:\n- Tori Amos was born as Myra Ellen Amos on August 22, 1963.\n- Tori Amos is an American singer-songwriter, pianist, and composer.\n- Tori Amos is a classically trained musician with a mezzo-soprano vocal range.\n- Tim Armstrong is best known as the singer and guitarist for the punk rock band Rancid and the hip hop/punk rock supergroup Transplants.\n- The Stories Are True was released on April 25, 2006, on Tim Armstrong's label Hellcat Records.",
